<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Good Morning, Beautiful! ✨</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0; padding: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffeef2 0%, #fff0f5 100%);
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            color: #4a4a4a;
            display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh; text-align: center;
        }
        .container { width: 90%; max-width: 400px; padding: 20px; }
        .heart-icon { font-size: 3rem; animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite; }
        h1 { font-size: 2rem; color: #ff6b81; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .subtitle { font-size: 1rem; color: #777; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        button {
            background-color: #ff6b81; color: white; border: none;
            padding: 12px 25px; font-size: 1rem; border-radius: 25px;
            cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 107, 129, 0.4);
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .hidden { display: none; }
        .card { background: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 15px; margin-top: 30px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .signature { text-align: right; margin-top: 20px; color: #ff6b81; }
        @keyframes float { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-10px); } }
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="heart-icon">☀️❤️</div>
        <h1>Good Morning, Sunshine!</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">I wanted to make your morning a little extra special today.</p>
        
        <button id="surpriseBtn" onclick="revealLetter()">Click for a morning message</button>
        
        <div id="loveLetter" class="hidden">
            <div class="card">
                <p>Hey Beautiful,</p>
                <p>I hope you slept well. I wanted you to wake up to something that reminds you of how much you mean to me. You make every day brighter just by being in it.</p>
                <p>Have an amazing day today. I'm always cheering for you!</p>
                <p class="signature">Forever yours, <br><strong>Your Name</strong></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function revealLetter() {
            var letter = document.getElementById("loveLetter");
            if (letter.classList.contains("hidden")) {
                letter.classList.remove("hidden");
                letter.style.animation = "fadeIn 0.8s ease-in-out forwards";
            } else {
                letter.classList.add("hidden");
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
